        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/coastaltown/_scene_copperhead.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository cfba4927-82b3-4e66-9816-5888b5c0f2ad).Image",
        "Description": "Fedra Giordano is rumored to have last been seen in Sapienza with her two most trusted companions. Fedra is famous for her hit-and-run backend business deals. She tends to butter her way up the proverbial ladder before inevitably revealing she&apos;s been lowballing them all along, but never before she&apos;s safely out of harm&apos;s way. This may work in the short term, but her habit of burning bridges has finally caught up now that we&apos;ve gotten her scent, 47. Take them down however you wish",
